UnitVoterPaymentsModule::withdrawToNFT
├── when destinations is empty
│   └── it should revert with NoDestinations
├── when the source authorization fails
│   └── it should revert with NotApprovedByOwner
└── when the source authorization passes
    ├── when a non mint leg carries a nonzero recipient
    │   └── it should revert with NonMintRecipientNotAllowed
    ├── when a zero amount non mint leg carries a nonzero recipient
    │   └── it should revert with NonMintRecipientNotAllowed
    ├── when total destinations amount is zero
    │   └── it should revert with ZeroWithdraw
    └── when total destinations amount is nonzero
        ├── when the operation is restricted and the caller is unregistered
        │   └── it should revert with NotRegistered
        └── when the operation is permissionless or the caller is registered
            ├── when a mint sentinel trims to zero
            │   └── it should drop the mint sentinel from the VE destinations
            ├── when destinations contain mint sentinels
            │   └── it should rewrite mint sentinels using minted ids
            ├── when destinations contain accumulator entries
            │   └── it should accept the entry as additional burn alongside the fee leg
            ├── when destinations produce trimming dust on a known example
            │   ├── it should keep destination amounts equal to proportional trim
            │   └── it should route the dust into the fee leg
            ├── when destinations produce trimming dust across fuzzed inputs
            │   └── it should keep the fee dust below the destination count
            ├── when every destination trims to zero
            │   └── it should revert with AllDestinationsTrimmedToZero
            ├── when some destinations trim to zero and some survive
            │   └── it should drop only the zero trimmed destinations
            ├── when an earlier destination trims to zero and a later one survives
            │   └── it should compact the survivor into the leading slot
            ├── when fee is zero
            │   ├── it should drop the fee leg from the VE destinations
            │   └── it should emit WithdrawnToNFT with fee zero
            └── when fee is non zero
                └── it should emit WithdrawnToNFT
